      "writtenOn": "2017-01-17T19:22:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We still need to have a gpio connected to the sys_rst_asserted interrupt. We just change which pad is connected to that gpio based on the board type. So boards using plt_rst_l signal will connect that signal to GPIO_SYS_RST_L_IN. \n\nShould I rename the signal to something else?",
